WEBVTT

00:00:02.327 --> 00:00:04.531
<v><b>Jessica:</b></v> Where in England are you from?

00:00:04.892 --> 00:00:07.035
<v><b>Richard:</b></v> We’re from here, from Oxford.

00:00:07.481 --> 00:00:09.396
<v><b>Jim:</b></v> Oxford’s a beautiful city!

00:00:09.835 --> 00:00:12.184
<v><b>Rachel:</b></v> Yes, it is. Are you on holiday?

00:00:12.729 --> 00:00:15.595
<v><b>Jim:</b></v> No we aren’t, we’re on business.

00:00:16.095 --> 00:00:17.841
But today’s a free day.

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:20.880
<v><b>Jessica:</b></v> Yes, we’re tourists today!

00:00:21.927 --> 00:00:22.338
Ooh.

00:00:22.718 --> 00:00:23.777
What’s that?

00:00:24.108 --> 00:00:26.745
<v><b>Jim:</b></v> Oh … Are they your dogs?

00:00:27.249 --> 00:00:28.631
<v><b>Richard:</b></v> Yes, they are.

00:00:29.196 --> 00:00:30.829
Sit. Sit!

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:33.672
<v><b>Jessica:</b></v> They’re very nice.

00:00:33.975 --> 00:00:37.048
But I’m not very good with dogs.

00:00:37.296 --> 00:00:39.963
<v><b>Jim:</b></v> Look – a free table. Over there.

00:00:40.332 --> 00:00:41.692
<v><b>Jessica:</b></v> Nice to meet you.

00:00:41.944 --> 00:00:43.164
Have a nice day.

00:00:43.654 --> 00:00:44.455
<v><b>Richard:</b></v> Thanks.

00:00:45.362 --> 00:00:46.552
Nice to meet you too.

00:00:46.621 --> 00:00:47.181
<v><b>Rachel:</b></v> Bye.